				""
				"&7&n石灰岩块&r&7是重铸材料的第一层级。"
				""
				"&7It is found in the &aOverworld&7, obtainable by &ecrafting&7 4x &fLimestone Blocks&r&8 (for 4 pieces)&7, or 4x &fDiorite Block&r &8(for 4 pieces)"
				""
				"&7可以重铸为以下品质："
